    description: Some("Pierre Touché drives a jumping 1935 Model A through a maze of one-ways, detours and secret passages, hunting the evidence and loot from Henri Le Fiend\'s crimes. Each case runs against a statute of limitations: find the evidence, verify it where it came from, return the stolen item to its owner one at a time, then catch Le Fiend and book him."),
